abstract: >-
  Stylometric detection of LLM-rewritten dark-web documents using sparse
  TF–IDF features. Browser research lab with a synthetic proxy corpus,
  LinearSVC / logistic detectors, and a methods report. Public / synthetic
  corpora only.
keywords:
  - stylometry
  - TF-IDF
  - LinearSVC
  - LLM detection
  - dark web
  - CoDA
